# QA Scenario YAML Schema

## Required Fields

```yaml
name: string          # Unique scenario identifier
steps: []             # Array of step objects
```

## Optional Fields

```yaml
description: string   # Human-readable description
tags: [string]        # Tags for filtering (smoke, regression, etc.)
requires:
  env: string | any | [string]  # Environment constraint
  user_role: string    # User role for login
  user_id: string      # Specific user ID
viewport:
  w: number
  h: number
  scale: number
setup: []              # Pre-test steps
teardown: []           # Post-test cleanup
recording:             # Override environment recording settings
  video: always | on-failure | off
  har: always | on-failure | off
  console: always | off
  trace: always | on-failure | off
  snapshot: always | per-step | start-end | off
```

## Step Types

### Navigation
- `open: "{baseUrl}/path"`
- `back: true`
- `forward: true`
- `reload: true`

### Wait
- `wait: { load: networkidle | load | domcontentloaded }`
- `wait: { url: "pattern" }`
- `wait: { text: "string" }`
- `wait: { selector: "css" }`
- `wait: { selector: "css", state: visible | hidden }`
- `sleep: 2000`

### Interaction
- `click: "selector"`
- `fill: { selector: "css", value: "text" }`
- `type: { selector: "css", value: "text" }`
- `press: "Enter"`
- `select: { selector: "css", value: "option" }`
- `check: "selector"`
- `uncheck: "selector"`
- `hover: "selector"`
- `focus: "selector"`

### Semantic Find
- `find: { role: "button", action: click }`
- `find: { role: "button", name: "Submit", action: click }`
- `find: { label: "Email", action: fill, value: "text" }`
- `find: { testid: "id", action: click }`
- `find: { placeholder: "text", action: fill, value: "text" }`
- `find: { text: "text", action: click }`

### Assertions
- `expect: { visible: "selector" }`
- `expect: { not_visible: "selector" }`
- `expect: { enabled: "selector" }`
- `expect: { checked: "selector" }`
- `expect: { url: "pattern" }`
- `expect: { url_contains: "string" }`
- `expect: { title_contains: "string" }`
- `expect: { text: { selector: "css", equals: "string" } }`
- `expect: { text: { selector: "css", contains: "string" } }`
- `expect: { count: { selector: "css", equals: 5 } }`
- `expect: { count: { selector: "css", gte: 1 } }`
- `expect: { value: { selector: "css", equals: "string" } }`
- `expect: { attr: { selector: "css", name: "attr", contains: "string" } }`

### Capture
- `screenshot: "filename.png"`
- `screenshot: { path: "file.png", full: true, annotate: true }`
- `snapshot: true`

### Config
- `set_viewport: { w: 1920, h: 1080 }`
- `set_headers: { "Header": "value" }`
- `cookies_clear: true`
- `storage_clear: local | session | all`
